SECTION 1 - PURPOSE AND SCOPE

This End User License Agreement ("Agreement") is a legal agreement between
the User and PickAngE (the "Author") governing the software named "Anti-Cheat
Scanner" (the "Software"), including its source files, binaries, documentation,
configuration files, generated reports, and associated resources.

BY ACCESSING, DOWNLOADING, OR USING THE SOFTWARE, THE USER AGREES TO BE BOUND
BY THIS AGREEMENT. IF THE USER DOES NOT ACCEPT THESE TERMS, THE USER MUST NOT
USE THE SOFTWARE.

The Software is a passive forensic and audit utility for analyzing third-party
anti-cheat software on a local Windows system. It is intended for systems that
the User owns or is legally authorized to inspect.

The Software is not designed to modify game behavior, inject code into
third-party processes, bypass protections, evade bans, or facilitate cheating.


